<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Baan upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Baan upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised its rating on Dutch software company Baan Co NV to outperform from neutral Thursday.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts (ADRs) rose two to 52-3/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
